# Defect 293, 2026-10-07. Symptom: the scanner asked of every character it
# refused, and of every foreign word, whether a quote left out had moved it
# out of a string (`lost_quote.lost_in`), and each asking walked back to its
# line's start and on to the line's end: a line of 4,000 refused characters
# cost `check` about a million instructions a character, its square. The
# text is read once for that question now (`lost_reading.hero`), and every
# message is what it was. Below, at a size the suite affords: a run past a
# quote on a line whose strings close, told; the same run, and foreign
# words, past a quote on a line that ends inside a literal, the literal's;
# and characters past no quote, told one by one to the file's eight, the
# rest counted. This file holds control characters on purpose.

